      "widgets_values": [
        "is a photograph of a minimalist interior featuring a white refrigerator and a wooden side table. The refrigerator, located on the right side of the image, stands against a plain, off-white wall. The refrigerator is a compact model with a single door at the top and a single door at the bottom. The top door has a small, horizontal handle. The name \"Hansa\" is written in bold, black letters on the front of the refrigerator. \n\nTo the left of the refrigerator is a light wooden side table with a geometric design. It has a rectangular shape and is supported by four slender, tapered legs. The table has a horizontal slatted surface and is positioned slightly off-center towards the left. \n\nOn the left side of the image, near the floor, is a small, potted plant in a terracotta pot. The plant has slender, green leaves and is placed on the wooden floor, adding a touch of nature to the otherwise minimalist setting. \n\nAbove the refrigerator, hanging from the ceiling, is a modern, black and white, cylindrical pendant light, providing a focal point and adding a touch of sophistication to the room. The overall style is modern and clean, with a focus on simplicity and functionality."
      ]
